          "body": "LuSql looks great!  It'd be wonderful to have it available under contrib.  I think a contrib/database would make sense?\n\nbq. In the FAQ, for [http://wiki.apache.org/lucene-java/LuceneFAQ#How_can_I_use_Lucene_to_index_a_database.3F|indexing databases with Lucene], LuSql should also be added (separate JIRA issue?)\n\n+1\n\nBut that's the wiki -- you can just go edit it (create an account if you don't already have one) and add it in (no need for a JIRA issue).",
